<title>USA: Chevron names new president for Canada unit.</title>
<headline>Chevron names new president for Canada unit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Corp said on Friday it named William Edman president of its Chevron Canada Resources Ltd unit effective November 1.</p>
<p>Edman, 55, replaces Don Paul, who was transferred to Chevron's San Francisco head office to become vice-president of technology.</p>
<p>Edman, a 32-year Chevron veteran, is currently managing director for Chevron Nigeria Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
